{"id":"f4e3ae7c7e6e5902","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction.md","title":"Theorem II.Ex7 Constant Sheaf and Global Sections Adjunction","display":"Theorem II.Ex7 Constant Sheaf and Global Sections Adjunction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction","aliases":["14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction"],"display":"Theorem II.Ex7 Constant Sheaf and Global Sections Adjunction","depends_on":["[[14-df-constant-sheaves]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","[[14-thm-topological-sheafification-by-germs]]"],"source_location":"II Exercise 7, printed 104; DjVu 58","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-constant-sheaf-global-sections-adjunction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.Ex7 Constant Sheaf and Global Sections Adjunction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"24c837c0a0986f5c\" href=\"?note=24c837c0a0986f5c\" title=\"14-df-constant-sheaves\">14-df-constant-sheaves</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d3c57938187ab03\" href=\"?note=0d3c57938187ab03\" title=\"14-thm-topological-sheafification-by-germs\">14-thm-topological-sheafification-by-germs</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II Exercise 7, printed 104; DjVu 58"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> 为拓扑空间，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> 上的层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_XA\">\\(\\Delta_XA\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}_X\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"24c837c0a0986f5c\" href=\"?note=24c837c0a0986f5c\" title=\"14-df-constant-sheaves\">14-df-constant-sheaves</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_a:X\\to A\">\\(c_a:X\\to A\\)</span> 为常值函数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_A\\)</span> 表示集合或函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的恒等映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\mathrm{Nat}_X(\\Delta_XA,F)\\to F(X)^A,\\qquad\\Phi(h)(a)=h_X(c_a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi:\\mathrm{Nat}_X(\\Delta_XA,F)\\to F(X)^A,\\qquad\\Phi(h)(a)=h_X(c_a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Psi:F(X)^A\\to\\mathrm{Nat}_X(\\Delta_XA,F),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Psi:F(X)^A\\to\\mathrm{Nat}_X(\\Delta_XA,F),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Psi(q):=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(\\Delta_XA,F,\\left(\\left\\{(u,s)\\in(\\Delta_XA)(U)\\times F(U)\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall a\\in A\\;s|_{u^{-1}[\\{a\\}]}=q(a)|_{u^{-1}[\\{a\\}]}\\right\\}\\right)_{U\\in\\tau}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Psi(q):=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(\\Delta_XA,F,\\left(\\left\\{(u,s)\\in(\\Delta_XA)(U)\\times F(U)\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall a\\in A\\;s|_{u^{-1}[\\{a\\}]}=q(a)|_{u^{-1}[\\{a\\}]}\\right\\}\\right)_{U\\in\\tau}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\\Phi=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Nat}_X(\\Delta_XA,F)},\\qquad\\Phi\\Psi=\\mathrm{id}_{F(X)^A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Psi\\Phi=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Nat}_X(\\Delta_XA,F)},\\qquad\\Phi\\Psi=\\mathrm{id}_{F(X)^A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>局部常值函数的各纤维是两两不交开集，覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(a)\">\\(q(a)\\)</span> 的相应限制可唯一拼接，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span>。空纤维不产生障碍，空域由层的唯一空截面处理。自然性和互逆性沿这些纤维检验。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_X\\dashv\\Gamma(X,-)\">\\(\\Delta_X\\dashv\\Gamma(X,-)\\)</span>，不需要假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 连通或局部连通。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-constant-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"24c837c0a0986f5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-constant-sheaves]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topological-sheafification-by-germs","status":"resolved","id":"0d3c57938187ab03","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-topological-sheafification-by-germs]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-constant-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"24c837c0a0986f5c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$F$ 是 $(X,\\tau)$ 上的层，$A\\in\\mathcal U$；$\\Delta_XA$、$\\mathrm{Nat}_X$ 见 [[14-df-constant-sheaves]]、[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]。对 $a\\in A$，$c_a:X\\to A$ 为常值函数。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$F$ 是 $(X,\\tau)$ 上的层，$A\\in\\mathcal U$；$\\Delta_XA$、$\\mathrm{Nat}_X$ 见 [[14-df-constant-sheaves]]、[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]。对 $a\\in A$，$c_a:X\\to A$ 为常值函数。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","hea